  "transcription": "Litt. Fr. $\\frac{1-u}{1} = \\frac{(1+\\frac{2}{3}u)uu\\alpha}{1-u}$\n\nTheorem\n$\\frac{1+\\frac{ab}{1.c}x+\\frac{a.a+1}{1.2}\\frac{b.b+1}{c.c+1}xx \\text{ etc}}{1+\\frac{c-a.c-b}{1.c}x+\\frac{c-a.c+1-a}{1.2}\\frac{c-b.c+1-b}{c.c+1}xx \\text{ etc.}} = (1-x)^{a+b-c}$\n\n$\\frac{1}{1-u}+\\frac{2}{u}+\\frac{1}{9+u}=0$\n$9u+uu$\n$u-uu$\n$18-16-2$\n$18-6u-2uu=0$\n$uu+3u=9$\n$u=-\\frac{3}{2}(1\\pm\\sqrt{5})$\n\nAuflösung der Gleichung $N = x\\frac{1+\\frac{6}{5}M+\\frac{2}{15}xx}{1+\\frac{6}{5}M-\\frac{6}{5}xx}$\nEs sei $\\frac{NN}{1+\\frac{6}{5}M}=\\alpha$\n$x = Nu$ so wird die Gleichung $1-\\frac{18}{15}\\alpha uu = u+\\frac{2}{15}\\alpha u^3$\n\n$\\alpha = \\frac{\\frac{15}{2}(1-u)}{(9+u)uu}$\n$\\alpha = \\frac{1-u}{1+\\frac{2}{3}u}uu$\n\n$u=v-3$\n$u^3+9uu+\\frac{15}{2\\alpha}u-\\frac{15}{2\\alpha}=0$\n$\\left.\\begin{matrix}v^3-27v+54\\\\+\\frac{15}{2\\alpha}v-\\frac{30}{\\alpha}\\end{matrix}\\right\\}=0$\n$p=9-\\frac{5}{2\\alpha}$\n$q=27-\\frac{15}{\\alpha}$\n$v=-\\sqrt[3]{\\{q+\\sqrt{(qq-p^3)}\\}}-\\sqrt[3]{\\{q-\\sqrt{(qq-p^3)}\\}}$\n\n$729-\\frac{810}{\\alpha}+\\frac{225}{\\alpha\\alpha}$\n$-729+\\frac{1215}{2\\alpha}-\\frac{675}{4\\alpha\\alpha}+\\frac{125}{8\\alpha^3}$\n$\\sqrt[3]{(27-\\frac{15}{\\alpha}+\\sqrt{\\{\\frac{125}{8\\alpha^3}+\\frac{225}{4\\alpha\\alpha}-\\frac{405}{2\\alpha}\\}}}$\n$\\frac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{6}$\n\n$1+\\frac{18}{5}-\\frac{324}{25}$\n$\\frac{1}{\\alpha}=-\\frac{9}{5}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{81}{5}}$\n$(\\frac{1}{\\alpha}+\\frac{9}{5})^2-\\frac{405}{25}$\n$\\frac{1}{\\alpha}$ 2,22 [?]\n$\\frac{1}{\\alpha}$ -5,82\n\n2,24\n-3,36\n-1,5\n-4,86\n+1,86\n$u=\\frac{3}{2}v$\n$\\alpha=\\frac{2-3u}{uu(6+u)}$ [?]\n$v=-1+\\sqrt{5}$\n$\\frac{5-3\\sqrt{5}}{5+\\sqrt{5}}$\n$\\frac{2-\\sqrt{5}}{1+\\sqrt{5}}$\nA $A^2$\n8649 590\n8059 561\n7498 539\n6959 514\n6445 495\n5950 473\n5477 454\n5023\n\n838916\n839259\n839430\n839451.37\n-0.86\n7.71\n839450.51 839443.66\n+1623.19 [-1246.38-]\n4869.58\n\n9,0000000\n9941704 9943335 9943291 9943292\n9,9883